      "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request optimizes the convert_ids_list_to_tokens function by deduplicating token IDs before decoding, which reduces redundant calls to the tokenizer. Feedback identifies a regression where the function fails if the input is an iterator or generator, as the set conversion exhausts the sequence before the final list comprehension; a suggestion was provided to convert the input to a list to ensure robustness across different iterable types.",
